div><br /></div><div>洪振民<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_1.html\" target=\"_blank\">鹿角龜</a></div><div>2</div><div><br /></div><div>郭欣怡<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ham.html\" target=\"_blank\">楓hām蝶仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>3</div><div><br /></div><div>陳俐雯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_62.html\" target=\"_blank\">青春走佗位去？</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>42</div><div><br /></div><h3>阿瑞--ā話仙</h3><div>藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_2.html\" target=\"_blank\">掠蝦仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</div><div><br /></div><h3>台語sa攏有講座</h3><div>主講／藍士博</div><div>記錄／李家銓<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/hoo.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hōo歷史浮出海面</a><br />6</div><div><br /></div><h3>Sann-kap讀小說</h3><div>張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/be.html\" target=\"_blank\">得bē著</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</div><div><br /></div><h3>讀冊開講</h3><div>洪明道<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tsua.html\" target=\"_blank\">地獄行一tsuā——讀《地獄谷》</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</div><div><br /></div><div>丁鳳珍、梁淑慧<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_4.html\" target=\"_blank\">《中學台語文教材教法》主編ê話</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>40</div><div><br /></div><h3>講古hōo lín聽</h3><div>Sih Sè-chhiong<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/the-virgins-lover-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Virgin’s lover ê故事</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</div><div><br /></div><h3>Ǹg夢五四三</h3><div>廖育辰<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ee.html\" target=\"_blank\">做家己ê樣、行家己ê路</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</div><div><br /></div><h3>文學káng「台」</h3><div>石牧民<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_41.html\" target=\"_blank\">歌仔冊ê浪漫</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</div><div><br /></div><h3>地名研究室</h3><div>黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">『水往上流』</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>20</div><div><br /></div><h3>Lán來講看māi</h3><div>主講／呂美親</div><div>記錄／白鎔維<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tie.html\" target=\"_blank\">《台文通訊》tī「台語文字化」工程ê實踐</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</div><div><br /></div><div>孫博萮<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/kah.html\" target=\"_blank\">高鐵kah發展之間無等號</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</div><div><br /></div><h3>台灣人寫真</h3><div>林榮淑<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ti_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">輸tī起走點——聽障女許樂寫驚奇</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>27</div><div><br /></div><div>林佳怡<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/12/blog-post_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">貓仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>29</div><div><br /></div><div>張家榮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">做伙畫豬</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</div><div><br /></div><h3>心內話</h3><div>汪美伶<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tui-thau-sik-sai-tai-bun.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tuì-thâu Si̍k-sāi Tâi-bûn</a></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tui-thau-sik-sai-tai-bun.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tuì頭熟sāi台文</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>34</div><div><br /></div><div>徐婷瑩<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_9.html\" target=\"_blank\">拍拚學台文ê收成</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>35</div><div><br /></div><div>張明敏<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_36.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮兜ê兩隻狗</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>36</div><div><br /></div><h3>棲地復育台語講座</h3><div>主講／張永州&nbsp;</div><div>記錄／田永承<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/12/blog-post_9.html\" target=\"_blank\">海產按怎食</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</div><div><br /></div><h3>寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</h3><div>陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">關鍵物種</a></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">Koan-kiān Bu̍t-chióng</a></div><div>44</div><div><br /></div><div>李江却台語文教基金會捐款徵信</div><div><span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>2022年10--月<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>46</div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_FO1Z6pflPNbfbBn-_ugvcT_6XYoBhX4H4CGfidPuvLFPIL-e3Vn0uWEKPBkPdLjhyQE9a5sX2Hf1hjx6EcN7i7Ja7zifRQcAKW-5cBdArkERZrxf9hWC5gLbWP8wnu3x9lvGNYFSf6xgD46dPiKR_ATZMoICj_uPZBC09aNMMqQgNnrcOcGdeDL8rw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_%E7%9B%AE%E9%8C%84.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_FO1Z6pflPNbfbBn-_ugvcT_6XYoBhX4H4CGfidPuvLFPIL-e3Vn0uWEKPBkPdLjhyQE9a5sX2Hf1hjx6EcN7i7Ja7zifRQcAKW-5cBdArkERZrxf9hWC5gLbWP8wnu3x9lvGNYFSf6xgD46dPiKR_ATZMoICj_uPZBC09aNMMqQgNnrcOcGdeDL8rw/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%